# Frontend Craft & Impeccable Design Standards

- **Server Components First**: React Server Components by default; isolate `'use client'` to leaf interactive nodes.
- **Eliminate Waterfalls**: Use `Promise.all` and React Suspense for parallel data fetching.
- **Aesthetic Excellence**: Use curated HSL color palettes, subtle luminous borders, clean typography. Never use browser-default raw inputs or unstyled buttons.
- **Responsive & Accessible**: Mobile-first breakpoints (375px, 768px, 1024px, 1440px), high text contrast, visible focus rings, ARIA labels.
